      "writtenOn": "2023-09-06T19:23:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Cached uploads for text are necessary if we want to play Recordings in any order, because they are used to set up the atlas in the state that the Recording expects. But they\u0027re only inserted in the command buffer if necessary so perhaps the data shouldn\u0027t be loaded into a Buffer until we actually need to do an upload.",
      "parentUuid": "d90cd716_6797a829",
      "revId": "81e8681a659457e6445b5554a5cb842fefc9f29d",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
